Package: shortsummary
Type: Package
Title: Removes less useful info from summaries of lm, glm and other objects in R
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Julian", "Faraway",
      email = "julian.faraway@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Removes the call, the residuals, extra empty lines and other less immediately
    relevant information from model summaries. Supports lm, glm, lme4, nlme, mgcv, survival,
    pscl, and MASS models. Adds optional show.nobs argument to display n and p. For binomial
    and Poisson GLMs, suppresses the redundant dispersion parameter line.
URL: https://github.com/julianfaraway/shortsummary
BugReports: https://github.com/julianfaraway/shortsummary/issues
Imports: methods
Suggests: lme4, nlme, mgcv, survival, pscl, MASS
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
